OL,3,GNEWSA'Running against my former self'
OL,4,Afor brain charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA running enthusiast who underwent
OL,7,Flife-saving surgery to remove a brain
OL,8,Ftumour is aiming to beat the ParkRun
OL,9,Fpersonal best time he set 14 years ago.
OL,11,FRoss Fripp from Fareham had a tumour
OL,12,Fremoved when he was aged 25 in 2014,
OL,13,Fand had further treatment when it
OL,14,Frecurred earlier this year.
OL,16,FAs part of his fundraising effort for
OL,17,Fneurology charity Smile4Wessex, he is
OL,18,Faiming to beat his previous best time
OL,19,Fof 16 minutes 58 seconds for a 5k run,
OL,20,Fwhich he achieved in 2012.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
